ICOSale.finalizeSale
├── when called by the owner and saleFinalized is false
│   ├── it sets saleFinalized = true
│   └── it emits SaleFinalized with the correct parameters
├── when called by the owner and saleFinalized is already true
│   └── it reverts with SaleAlreadyFinalized
└── when called by a non-owner
    └── it reverts with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
